# Testing Conventions

## Unit tests (Vitest) — test files colocated with source

```ts
// apps/web/src/lib/bkt.test.ts
import { describe, it, expect } from 'vitest'
import { updateSubAxis, getKnowledgeProbability } from './bkt'

describe('BKT', () => {
  it('increases knowledge probability on correct answer', async () => {
    const before = await getKnowledgeProbability(userId, 'grammar.deHet')
    await updateSubAxis(userId, 'grammar.deHet', { correct: true, responseTimeMs: 1200 })
    const after = await getKnowledgeProbability(userId, 'grammar.deHet')
    expect(after).toBeGreaterThan(before)
  })
})
```

## What to unit test
- `lib/bkt.ts` — BKT update math
- `lib/fsrs.ts` — FSRS scheduling intervals
- `lib/story-calibration.ts` — i+1 vocabulary % calculation
- `lib/engagement.ts` — frustration/boredom thresholds
- All Zod schemas

## E2E tests (Playwright) — in `apps/web/e2e/`

```ts
// apps/web/e2e/auth.spec.ts
test('user can sign up and reach dashboard', async ({ page }) => {
  await page.goto('/')
  await page.getByRole('link', { name: 'Get started' }).click()
  // ...
})
```

## E2E critical paths to always cover
1. Auth flow (signup, login, password reset)
2. Document upload (upload → processing → ready)
3. Free-Write (write → AI analysis → weakness map updated)
4. SRS review session (review → FSRS reschedule)
